# Apply Changes Gate

- Do not modify any files unless I explicitly say: "APPLY CHANGES".
- Default behavior:
  - Read and analyze freely.
  - Propose diffs and patches only.
  - Do not run file-writing commands, formatters, or generators that change files.
- When I say "APPLY CHANGES":
  - Apply only the agreed edits.
  - Do not add unrelated refactors or extra changes.
  - Summarize exactly what changed after edits are applied.
